Subject: [PATCH 0944/3799] soh: rename func_809B27D8 -> EnAnubiceFire_Fly

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: flight state: grows the fireball, trails KiraKira sparkles, reverses course when reflected by the mirror shield and switches to the burst state on impact.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Anubice_Fire/z_en_anubice_fire.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
